\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  While Jesus was still a child
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 he grew in majesty
\par in wisdom and love of God
\par and strong in the spirit.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2. All his friends respected him
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 His people loved him too
\par His love and his purity
\par drew them closer to him.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. He studied the scriptures of God
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 from his parent's tuition
\par Together with his parents
\par went to Jerusalem.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  He went to the house of God
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 and listened to God's words
\par He sought after the teachers
\par and asked them questions too.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.   They in turn questioned him also
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 He gave them right answers
\par and his speech and his knowledge
\par surprised them very much.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6.   His parents went searching for him
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 He sat in the temple
\par He thought he was all doing
\par His father's will fulfilled
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7.   He went home with his parents
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 was obedient to them
\par he lived in humility
\par and worked with diligence.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 8\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 8. Children, learn of this Jesus
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 His humble example
\par respect God and your parents
\par and the elderly too.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 9\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 9.  Look to the saviour Jesus
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 His speech and behavior
\par  He is your best example
\par  He's the only saviour
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 10\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 10.Learn from the scriptures always
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  and walk in its guidance
\par  so by the grace of Jesus
\par  you enter in his joy.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

